  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/falden-fixtures/falden-fixture-pack/zipball/anchor/predicates-2",
  "body": "Anchor #2 of the Falden fixture pack. The tag's tree holds:\n\n- `anchor/predicates-2.manifest`: the sha256 of each file on the pack's verdict path, of the error taxonomy, of capture format 1 and of the release and recovery public keys, under a first line naming the build commit it was prepared from\n- `anchor/predicates-2.sig`: the release key's signature over the manifest\n- `anchor/predicates-2.tsr` (DigiCert) and `anchor/predicates-2.tsr2` (GlobalSign): RFC 3161 timestamp tokens over that signature\n- `anchor/allowed_signers` and `anchor/tsa-ca.pem`: the signing keys, and both authorities' certificate chains\n- `anchor/predicates-2.diff` and `anchor/predicates-2.reasons.json`: the change against predicates-1 and one reason per changed file.\n- `freeze/rehearsal/`: the rehearsal record, each digest with two RFC 3161 tokens. The answer key's digest was timestamped on 2026-11-11, after the rehearsal.\n- `freeze/calendar/`: the live run's calendar as intent, with two RFC 3161 tokens over it.\n\nCheck the signature with stock OpenSSH:\n\n```\nssh-keygen -Y verify -f anchor/allowed_signers -I falden-fixture-release -n falden-fixture-anchor -s anchor/predicates-2.sig < anchor/predicates-2.manifest\n```\n\nCheck both timestamps with OpenSSL 3 (macOS's stock LibreSSL cannot verify GlobalSign's tokens):\n\n```\nopenssl ts -verify -in anchor/predicates-2.tsr -data anchor/predicates-2.sig -CAfile anchor/tsa-ca.pem\nopenssl ts -verify -in anchor/predicates-2.tsr2 -data anchor/predicates-2.sig -CAfile anchor/tsa-ca.pem\n```\n"
